= Instructions

In a #Cocktail shaker{} with @Ice{}, combine the @Japanese whiskey{1 1/2 oz}, preferably Nikka Coffey Grain Whisky 
and @White crème de cacao{1/2 oz} and stir until chilled.

Strain into a #Rocks glass{} filled with @Ice{}.

Using a #Saucepan{}, bring the @Coconut water{1 oz}, preferably Vita Coco to a boil, then turn off the heat.

In a #Bowl{}, whisk the @Powdered matcha{1 tablespoon}, preferably Fukujyu with coconut water just off the boil.

Add the matcha mixture to the rocks glass and stir.

Garnish with a fresh leaf of @Shiso or kinome{}.